      "date": "2026-03-20T00:02:07+08:00",
      "author": "Freeman Liu",
      "email": "llw599502537@gmail.com",
      "message": "feat: propagate gRPC context deadline in GrpcClientOptionsClientInterceptor (#151)\n\n* feat: propagate gRPC context deadline in GrpcClientOptionsClientInterceptor\n\nWhen no explicit deadline is set on a call and no configured deadline exists,\nautomatically propagate the deadline from the current gRPC Context so that\ndownstream calls inherit the remaining deadline of the incoming request.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* revert 40-configuration-properties.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
